<title>UK: Air India ups UK-India cargo rates 5-8pct.</title>
<headline>Air India ups UK-India cargo rates 5-8pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air India said it will raise its cargo rates from the UK to India by between five and eight percent from April 1.</p>
<p>It said increases would vary from one weight breakdown category to another.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+ 44 171 542 7706; fax +5017</p>
